   "id": "R6-HRA-D5",
   "summary": "mentions mode amount cannot read a suffixed target value ('$4.2M' -> predicate_mentions_value_unavailable) although the text side reads '$4.2M' exactly; source amounts with k/M suffix must be restated as a plain literal ('$4,200,000') for sole checks.",
